Z||000004||SloPonti||01-31-2000||12:46 AM||||yes there is room! i did it! i used the license plate neon frames! they are brighter and cheaper! i picked them up or 19.99 a peice! i made custom switches and mounted them in the center consale panel were the power windo switches are! i have two swiches! one for the under dash neon lights and one for the under car neon lights! the ones under the dash are mounted will real small wire and i just tied it up to differnt things under the dash! the license plate fram has four holes for the the licens plane screws!  i used these four holes! also these are cheapys and my under car ones are top quality! they are all purple lights and you can tell a diffecne in brightness between the cheap under dash ones and the expenseve under car ones!they are made of lexon and then the neon is hand blowed glass! they have a lifetime warrenty on them for damge and they are gaurenteed to never burn out! i will take picutes tomorrow night and post sometime tomorrow night! thanks and if anymore questions let me know!!||||reg||1
