Z||000010||SloPonti||02-01-2000||12:17 AM||||well here i took pictures of them not lit up! i also have some more but no more space on my page! if someone has some more space let me know and i will email you some more pictures! <BR>picture1-neon under drives side<BR>picture2-neon under passenger side<BR>picture3-sitches-one switch for inside neons<BR>         and one switch for the undercar<BR>         neons<BR>picture4-back undercar neon<BR>picture5-passenger under car neon<BR> <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/neon1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/neon1.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/neon2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/neon2.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/switch.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/switch.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/neon3.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/neon3.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/sloponti/neon4.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/sloponti/neon4.jpg</A> <P>the inside neons have been installed for about 3 years now and no problem! the under car neon has been installed for about a year now and no poblems with them yet and no broken tubes yet! when the lights go out the neons come on and my fiero looks like it is floating on a blanket of purple air! totally cool! when the fieo is up and running i will take pictures of the car lit up as soon as i can and post! i also have custom fog lights mounted on the fiero! i have a picture of them to! there is one more neon on the car and that is in the motor compartment but i have that one removed right now since the motor is out!<BR>thanks and let me know what you think!!!||||reg||1
